  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41301" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Export Capacity for agri-commodities at the Izmail port facility and providing grain storage support for Ukrainian farmers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has been designed to incorporate efficiencies and improvements along the entirety of the supply chains for food and grain commodities. FAO is additionally working with partners to increase storage capacity in the country so that grain can be stored and then exported once port capacity has been increased. Significant impacts of the project are expected at national, regional and local levels, as the port increases its capacity and contribution to national and global food security.</narrative>
  </description>
